{"id":"a4894b7383014259","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-solovay-degree.md","title":"Solovay Equivalence, Strict Order, and Degrees","display":"df-solovay-degree — Solovay Equivalence, Strict Order, and Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-solovay-degree","aliases":["43-df-solovay-degree"],"display":"df-solovay-degree — Solovay Equivalence, Strict Order, and Degrees","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-red]]","[[43-thm-solovay-preorder]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§13.4, structure of the Solovay degrees","source_printed_pages":"345–346","source_pdf_pages":"365–366","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-solovay-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-solovay-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-solovay-degree — Solovay Equivalence, Strict Order, and Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84a32d5c69ef656e\" href=\"?note=84a32d5c69ef656e\" title=\"43-thm-solovay-preorder\">43-thm-solovay-preorder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13.4, structure of the Solovay degrees"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"345–346"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"365–366"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>。本节引入集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>、二元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_S,&lt;_S\">\\(\\equiv_S,&lt;_S\\)</span>、商集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}\">\\(\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}\\)</span> 及其序关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_S\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 的自反性与传递性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"84a32d5c69ef656e\" href=\"?note=84a32d5c69ef656e\" title=\"43-thm-solovay-preorder\">43-thm-solovay-preorder</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\equiv_S\\beta\\iff\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\alpha.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\equiv_S\\beta\\iff\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\beta\\le_S\\alpha.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;_S\\beta\\iff\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\neg(\\beta\\le_S\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha&lt;_S\\beta\\iff\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\land\\neg(\\beta\\le_S\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\alpha]_S\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathcal L:\\alpha\\equiv_S\\beta\\}\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\alpha]_S\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\mathcal L:\\alpha\\equiv_S\\beta\\}\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathcal L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}\\coloneqq\\{[\\alpha]_S:\\alpha\\in\\mathcal L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}\\coloneqq\\{[\\alpha]_S:\\alpha\\in\\mathcal L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\preccurlyeq_S b\\iff\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\bigl(a=[\\alpha]_S\\land b=[\\beta]_S\\land\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\bigr)\\qquad(a,b\\in\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\preccurlyeq_S b\\iff\\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\bigl(a=[\\alpha]_S\\land b=[\\beta]_S\\land\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\bigr)\\qquad(a,b\\in\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>预序的双向部分是等价关系；传递性使商上的序不依赖代表元，反对称性由等价类相等给出。严格关系指度严格下降，不等同于实数通常大小关系。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§13.4, structure of the Solovay degrees；印刷页 345–346，PDF 页 365–366。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-solovay-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"84a32d5c69ef656e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 与 $\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。本节引入集合 $\\mathcal L$、二元关系 $\\equiv_S,<_S$、商集 $\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}$ 及其序关系 $\\preccurlyeq_S$；$\\le_S$ 的自反性与传递性见 [[43-thm-solovay-preorder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-solovay-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"84a32d5c69ef656e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 与 $\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。本节引入集合 $\\mathcal L$、二元关系 $\\equiv_S,<_S$、商集 $\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}$ 及其序关系 $\\preccurlyeq_S$；$\\le_S$ 的自反性与传递性见 [[43-thm-solovay-preorder]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_S,<_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L/{\\equiv_S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R:\\m